WEBVTT

00:00:00.507 --> 00:00:01.260
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.186 --> 00:00:07.147
<v><b>M:</b></v> I feel as though I’ve been with this company forever; in fact, by 2035,

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.973
I’ll have been working here for 25 years.

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:12.820
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:16.538
<v><b>F:</b></v> I never knew he’d worked as a teacher when he was younger.

00:00:16.765 --> 00:00:19.193
I thought he’d always been in the music business.

00:00:21.085 --> 00:00:21.872
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:22.632 --> 00:00:26.357
<v><b>M:</b></v> I was working as a waiter in a cocktail bar when I met my partner.

00:00:28.288 --> 00:00:29.035
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:29.881 --> 00:00:35.497
<v><b>F:</b></v> Both my kids are working this summer because they want to earn some money to go travelling in September.

00:00:37.449 --> 00:00:38.236
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:39.103 --> 00:00:41.900
<v><b>F:</b></v> Have you really been working in the garden all morning?

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.147
It doesn’t look as though you’ve done very much!

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:46.953
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:47.786 --> 00:00:53.681
<v><b>F:</b></v> Ann is a world-class make-up artist and has worked with over two hundred Hollywood stars.

00:00:55.662 --> 00:00:56.435
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:57.315 --> 00:01:02.137
<v><b>M:</b></v> Most of the Ford employees had been working on the new model for over six months

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:04.505
when the news of the factory closure was announced.

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:07.111
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:07.991 --> 00:01:12.063
<v><b>M:</b></v> Will you be working from home at all next week, or will you be in the office every day?